Spoiler alert!


Try cracking one open with a pickaxe.  Get next to it (one square over)
and apply the pickaxe (dwarves have picks) in that direction.  They
turn into a pile of rocks.  You may occasionally find a spellbook in
the mess.  There may be other ways to break them, too (wand of digging,
striking?)

